:"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T16:23:24-08:00","id":19946,"title":"","content":"Used to use it, with the skin from the Players' Handbook. Of course that was years ago when I was in a maniac high and survived roleplaying on Yahoo chatrooms, jamming to some metal (after getting Elisabeth to sleep reading clanbooks to her). If the company wants to ditch the application, let it. I got Windows Media Player now and if Mom sees me with my headphones on, she knows I am not to be disturbed. It means either I am jamming to music or Netflix.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T07:37:46-08:00","id":49772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://lifehacker.com/winamp-our-favorite-media-player-for-windows-is-shutt-1468411866/1501026364/@ericravenscraft\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://lifehacker.com/images/lifehacker-logo.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://lifehacker.com/winamp-our-favorite-media-player-for-windows-is-shutt-1468411866/1501026